# Informational Separability Simulator
### Visual Evidence Machine for *Error Catastrophe in Evolving Substrates*

This repository transforms the theoretical framework from  
**“Informational Separability as a Physical Order Parameter in Evolving Substrates”**  
into a dynamic, visual proof engine.

---

## 🧠 Overview

Physical information systems — from reaction‑diffusion substrates to nonlinear maps — encode and process information through their evolving states.  
This project demonstrates how **Informational Separability (x)** acts as a measurable control parameter governing recoverability and error‑catastrophe transitions.

